  "body": "## Changelog\n* 1349a6ad6da8fe26b6bc449d35aaf2c370c0f484 docs(sensors): Tp0u/v/w track Tp0y/z/10, they are not byte aliases\n* d01aac65d3a179d1693fa40a43e881ab762801e5 feat(guess): add --save/--replay and per-phase CPU load report\n* e65984c88c20751bb039cd98f00ae6fd87365a62 feat(sensors): import fourth M3 Pro dump (MBP 14\", Nov 2023)\n* 558ee99254c97ea11999f5fe5a8fd1dc54429b4a fix(guess): settle on signed drift, report empty phases, skip them in rebalance\n* 837ae1db7d96cff2e2e9b11e697f0b56cb577efd fix(sensors): map M6 P-cores from owner guess runs\n\n"
